# Base URL of the Orchestrel API.
#
# Public configuration, not a secret — it is compiled into the browser
# bundle by Vite at build time. Never put a database URL, broker URL, or
# any credential in a VITE_* variable: everything here is world-readable.
#
# Local development (Compose publishes the API on 8000):
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000
#
# Production example (set in the Render dashboard, not committed):
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://orchestrel-api.onrender.com
#
# A production build with this unset FAILS rather than silently baking in
# localhost — see frontend/vite.config.ts.
